{"h":3209,"w":2400,"lines":[{"t":"Sample Writing answers","c":1,"w":0.22912620544433604,"x":0.66601942136802927,"y":0.036337209386160252,"h":0.015999239033256396},{"y":0.08430232585441233,"x":0.10679611344661662,"w":0.72427185058593746,"t":"The third paragraph presents the other side, that scientists do not often know","h":0.018895348284474811,"c":1},{"x":0.10679610926113146,"y":0.10311526496041146,"c":1,"t":"what they will find. Examples of two innovations are given [dynamite | penicillin] to","w":0.76699030558268233,"h":0.017524270030939704},{"h":0.017470839907447133,"c":1,"w":0.17087378184000651,"x":0.10679611881750121,"t":"support this point.","y":0.12209302311296732},{"w":0.76116505940755208,"t":"Ideas are logically organised and paragraphs have clear central topics. Cohesive","h":0.016199376947040545,"y":0.15981308435875397,"c":1,"x":0.10485436340198721},{"t":"devices are used appropriately with some appropriate referencing [them | their |","h":0.015988371899566145,"c":1,"w":0.74757283528645835,"x":0.10679610652945692,"y":0.17877906986203862},{"y":0.19767441849138745,"w":0.74368932088216144,"h":0.017590378972228815,"c":1,"t":"if], although linkers often appear at the start of the sentence, which can seem a","x":0.10485436856989831},{"w":0.74563105265299479,"c":1,"t":"little mechanical [On one hand | On the other hand | While | Overall | However |","h":0.017594001152062444,"x":0.10485437655198335,"y":0.21511627895442875},{"x":0.10656501890031161,"w":0.12301601409912108,"c":1,"y":0.23344136046267006,"t":"Sometimes].","h":0.017135349166727543},{"w":0.71663029988606775,"h":0.020102472988615894,"c":1,"y":0.27007362695774195,"x":0.10478699648144063,"t":"In order to improve the overall rating, the second paragraph could be further"},{"h":0.014641744548286595,"w":0.71844660441080721,"t":"extended and the use of cohesive devices could be less mechanical and not","c":1,"y":0.29065420559162825,"x":0.10679611517594907},{"t":"always at the start of each sentence.","y":0.30809968824382827,"h":0.017481707041137273,"x":0.10679612268302492,"w":0.35145629882812501,"c":1},{"c":1,"x":0.10679612850513043,"y":0.3457943923820993,"t":"However, this is a strong, higher-level response to the task.","w":0.55922327677408856,"h":0.017577700748621861},{"w":0.042718445460001697,"h":0.01308139551465759,"x":0.85436893250193024,"y":0.95203488360168276,"t":"129","c":1}]}